 come in and meet  because these guys they want to grow  their business as well another you not  just pitching them in this value that  you could potentially break through the  people as well then most of the time to  be willing to come and take your meeting  so I would do a Google search and it  also looked for Google News if you sign  up for Google News Alerts you could type  in certain keywords you can type in your  family mediator or family lawyer  followed by I think you said you were in  Toronto or Richmond Hill put those  keywords in and anytime somebody's  mentioned in the news and that their  family mediator or family lawyer you'll  get an email and that's a great way to  be able to quickly introduce yourself to  say hey I saw that you were featured in  the Toronto Star Congrats in a great  article I had this great coaching  program and I think you know we might be  able to help each other I would love to  take you out for coffee and introduce  myself and learn a little bit more about  your business as well suddenly my first  approach go out and target them I think  you'd have a much better success rate  than just going to meet up events a  board of trade events and hoping that  your ideal connector is there if you're  finding that it's really hard to get in  front of these people and they're saying  no and they're too busy and they don't  want to just network with you the next  thing you can do is try to interview  them so interview them and where you can  do is put together a guide of advice  from the top family lawyers in Toronto  and you can say I'm creating this guy  then gonna be promoting up the top  family lawyers in Toronto and their  advice and I'd love to interview you  they'll take half an hour and get your  tips and opinions on what's happening  with family law and you know why  somebody should sign up and buy from you  so there you're offering a lot of value  to somebody and you actually have to go  through and you know create this  publication but it could just be an  online ebook that you promote from your  website and people are generally  flattered by it and they want the  exposure and publicity and attention so  it's a lot easier to get that meeting  and of course then they become curious  about what you're doing and how you're  gonna promote it and what your business  is all about so it's a great way to get  that introduction when I had one of my  first software companies we were trying  to sell into salespeople insurance  brokers for financial advisors and at  the time we weren't a known quantity and  you know we were young entrepreneurs so  we did was we partnered up with a whole  bunch of highly famous and successful  writers like Zig Ziglar and Tom Peters  and we created a guide to professional  success and we email all of them and  said we'd love to interview you or take  one of your articles but professional  success and put it together in a guide  and I also wrote my own article too and  I contributed to it so now I'm an author  with all these great authors and we  publish it and release it on on our  website and that was a great way to get  that first introduction to a lot of  these expert authors who otherwise  wouldn't have paid any attention to us  and we were just a startup company  nobody really knew who we were but they  all said yes so that could be a great  way to introduce yourself to some of  these companies if you're finding that  they don't want to meet with you for  coffee to discuss each other's  businesses so that's what I would do I  think you'd have a much better hit rate  I think people would be open to meeting  with you and if enough people learn  about what you're doing then when they  see that their clients have a need then  they're much more likely to to refer  them to you because they know you they  like you they've met you they like what  your business is all about they see that  you're a friendly person and they think  you can help their clients so hopefully  that helps Caroline if you guys like the  video please give it a thumbs up below  and it also love to hear oh you have to  think if you want to leave a comment  under the video and stay tuned for next  episode  [Music]  you  [Music]

